<title>USA: TENNIS-RESULTS AT TOSHIBA CLASSIC.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-RESULTS AT TOSHIBA CLASSIC.</headline>
<dateline>CARLSBAD, California 1996-08-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Results from the</p>
<p>$450,000 Toshiba Classic tennis tournament on Sunday (prefix</p>
<p>number denotes seeding):</p>
<p>Finals:</p>
<p>4-Kimiko Date (Japan) beat 1-Arantxa Sanchez Vicario (Spain)</p>
<p>3-6 6-3 6-0.</p>
</text>
